{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます！\n森平麗心です🐱🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026\n北海道公演２日間ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mob6NLWkR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mob3vTTfA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道の美味しいものをたくさん食べたので、私もEラインが綺麗になっていたらいいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🦊⚾️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobiPvSQd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobAojNTh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道またいきたいな〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてりおたんの地元北海道で、\n42枚目シングルに収録される6期生楽曲の『命の色』を披露できたことが嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も素敵な楽曲をありがとうございます\n；＿；"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この曲を聞くたびに、私は汚れてる自分を好きになれます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの方に届きますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ストリーミング＆ダウンロードよろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は6期生みんなのことが大好きなので…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "披露したとき、私の心には6期生11人がいました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また11人みんなで同じステージに立って、\n同じ景色を見られる日が来ますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もりひらうるみ"}], "source": "official"}